    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "已知：\n$\\angle1$，\n$\\angle2$，\n$\\angle3$ 是三角形 $ABC$ 的三个内角。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 164,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0174#8"
      ],
      "source_text": "已知：$\\angle1$，$\\angle2$，$\\angle3$ 是三角形 $ABC$ 的三个内角.",
      "changes": [
        "translation",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "求证：\n$\\hat{1}+\\hat{2}+\\hat{3}=180^\\circ$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 164,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0174#9"
      ],
      "source_text": "求证：$\\hat{1}+\\hat{2}+\\hat{3}=180^\\circ$.",
      "changes": [
        "translation",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "证明。\n过三角形 $ABC$ 的顶点 $C$，作直线 $AB$ 的平行线 $MN$。\n延长边 $AC$ 和边 $BC$（图 233）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 164,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0174#10",
        "p0174#12"
      ],
      "source_text": "证明. 经过三角形 $ABC$的顶点 $C$ 作直线 $AB$ 的平行线$MN$. 延长 $AC$ 边和 $BC$ 边(图 233).",
      "changes": [
        "translation",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "cap",
      "text": "图 233",
      "id": null,
      "label": "图 233",
      "printed_page": 164,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0174#11"
      ],
      "source_text": "图 233",
      "changes": [],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "射线 $AF$ 和 $CF$ 的方向相同，射线 $AB$ 和射线 $CN$ 的方向也相同。\n由这些射线方向相同，可得：\n$\\hat{1}=\\hat{4}$（见第 37 小节）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 164,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0174#13"
      ],
      "source_text": "射线 $AF$ 和 $CF$ 的方向相同，而射线 $AB$ 和射线 $CN$ 的方向相同. 由于这些射线的方向相同，得到：$\\hat{1}=\\hat{4}$ (见第 37 小节).",
      "changes": [
        "translation",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "同理可证：\n$\\hat{3}=\\hat{6}$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 164,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0174#14"
      ],
      "source_text": "同样可以证明：$\\hat{3}=\\hat{6}$.",
      "changes": [
        "translation",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "因为角 2 和角 5 是对顶角，所以 $\\hat{2}=\\hat{5}$。\n也就是说，$\\hat{1}+\\hat{2}+\\hat{3}=\\hat{4}+\\hat{5}+\\hat{6}$。\n而角 4、角 5 和角 6 的和是平角 $MCN$。\n\n因此，$\\hat{1}+\\hat{2}+\\hat{3}=180^\\circ$。\n$\\blacksquare$",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 164,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0174#15",
        "p0175#1"
      ],
      "source_text": "因为角 2 和角 5 是对顶角，所以 $\\hat{2}=\\hat{5}$. 这就是说，$\\hat{1}+\\hat{2}+\\hat{3}=\\hat{4}+\\hat{5}+\\hat{6}$.但是，角 4、角 5 和角 6 的和是平角 $MCN$. 所以 $\\hat{1}+\\hat{2}+\\hat{3}=180^\\circ$. $\\blacksquare$",
      "changes": [
        "translation",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "* 为了表述简便，多边形内角的大小（以及外角的大小）也可以叫做多边形的内角（外角）。",
      "id": null,
      "label": "note",
      "printed_page": 164,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0174#16"
      ],
      "source_text": "* 为简便起见，多边形内角的大小(和它的外角的大小)也可以叫做多边形的内角(外角).",
      "changes": [
        "translation",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "推论 1。\n如果三角形有一个内角是直角或钝角，那么另外两个内角都是锐角。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 165,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0175#2"
      ],
      "source_text": "推论 1. 如果三角形中有一个角是直角或者是钝角，那么另外两个角是锐角.",
      "changes": [
        "translation",
        "layout"
      ],
      "numeric_changes": [],
      "historical_entities": []
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "text": "推论 2。\n等边三角形的每个内角都等于 $60^\\circ$。",
      "id": null,
      "label": null,
      "printed_page": 165,
      "source_refs": [
        "p0175#3"
      ],
      "source_text": "推论 2. 等边三角形的每一个内角等于 $60^\\circ$.",
      "changes": [
        "translation",
